{"page":20214,"part":1,"text":"六朝人书\n\n\n六朝人书\n\n晋、宋、南 北齐、梁、陈、隋之间，工书者林立，两晋称二王之妙，南 北重崔、卢之书，又羊欣、阮研、徐淮南、陶隐居、姚元标、丁道护等皆其选也。据《金石萃编》所载，六朝碑刻有一百四十馀种，近阮宫保、孙渊如、黄小松、赵晋斋诸家所藏，又益二三十种。其间如《刁遵》、《高湛》、《郑道昭》、《元太仆》、《启法寺》、《龙藏寺》诸碑，实欧、虞、褚、薛所祖，惟时值乱离，未遑讲论文翰，甚至破体杂出，错落不检，而刻工之恶劣，若生平未尝识字者，诸碑中竟有十之七八，可笑也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20214,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"43dfe5d991747aafd77f81caf3542bbb704708fa2c42f71ac4dbfa9e2eec9c49","textSha256":"43dfe5d991747aafd77f81caf3542bbb704708fa2c42f71ac4dbfa9e2eec9c49","fileSha256":"43dfe5d991747aafd77f81caf3542bbb704708fa2c42f71ac4dbfa9e2eec9c49","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20214-work-149.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"书学 · 六朝人书","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/u3X8UHVmvxDaReSv7bnrND","originalPages":[633],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"eea6e3dbce5f1f9367d17da1108acc51699c792eb9291c394a9d47a78bb91b00","id":"local-633-155-166","page_id":633,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":155,"rawEnd":166,"reviewedTextSha256":"53ade8f578077ba2508b3c2d1082aeccbc7e6c3427d381bdaa3a414813ac5f49","displayUnitOrigins":[[161,162],[162,163],[163,164],[164,165],[165,166]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":633,"part":3,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"宋品宣","verifiedAt":"2026-10-20T08:27:37.971Z","revision":"53ade8f578077ba2508b3c2d1082aeccbc7e6c3427d381bdaa3a414813ac5f49","textSha256":"53ade8f578077ba2508b3c2d1082aeccbc7e6c3427d381bdaa3a414813ac5f49","fileSha256":"5e3a8e126438f8956a4f6192ae403b5c724c1b67665b9c18af94841661f1f0de","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-pac